> The sky becomes completely dark.
@fx DOOOOM | gong
@title THE RESURRECTION BEGINS | DAY 1 OF 37 | Seven guardians remain. Seven traitors stand against them.

@bg graves
@page
@panel wide | kael, mira | Under a black sky, torchlight on a hillside: Kael and the survivors burying Seran beside Auren's memorial stone
> Kael and the survivors bury Seran near Auren's memorial.
> Mira produces a sealed leather journal that Seran placed in her care during the evacuation.
@panel wide | mira, kael | Mira holding out a sealed, worn leather journal toward Kael by torchlight, solemn
@show right mira
MIRA: Seran told me to keep this safe.
@show left kael
KAEL: What is it?
MIRA: Auren's journal. Some pages are sealed. I haven't opened them.
KAEL: Keep it safe until we finish this.
@panel square | mira | Close-up of Mira's hands closing her satchel over the journal, resolute
> She closes her bag.
